{"games":[{"id":2960777560,"name":"Treasure Quest","desc":"⚔️ Welcome to Treasure Quest! Loot treasure, battle monsters, and complete unique quests as you and your friends become the ultimate treasure hunters! Fight as a Wizard, Warrior, or Archer in over a dozen unique dungeons!\n\n⭐️ How To Play:\n- Press the PLAY button to create a dungeon!\n- Defeat bosses for new weapons & loot!\n- Upgrade your weapons & skills to grow stronger!\n- Level up to unlock new dungeons & other features!\n\n🎮 Controls:\n- Desktop: Click to attack, F to use your ability, & LShift to sprint!\n- Mobile: Tap to attack, use your ability, & sprint!\n- XBOX: X to attack, Y to use your ability, & LB to sprint!\n- Playstation: Square to attack, Circle to use your ability, & L1 to sprint!\n\n🤑 Roblox Premium Benefits: +25% Gold, +25% XP, +25% Luck, & claim AFK rewards 25% faster!\n💜 Join Nosniy Games for a free Sword, Chat Tag, and Prize Wheel access! https://www.roblox.com/groups/3461453","path":"/game/2960777560-treasure-quest","slug":"2960777560-treasure-quest","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e90ce8a86d43c2de5b8aec083d071911f62b3f4d0a66777d156c1fb29136ca53.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aeeb4ec091357fe2d9641c0c19263b72/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":20,"visitor":574130711,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-28T23:48:58.468Z","creator":{"name":"Nosniy Games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":3}},{"id":5438861164,"name":"Sacrifice Sanctuary","desc":"Compete against 11 other contestants in a deadly competition to live and be the one to walk away free from the Sacrifice Sanctuary.\n\n🩸 Compete in many different types of competitions\n👑 Win daily matches to unlock exclusive crowns and streak rewards\n💀 Reach Level 5 to enter the Basement Battle mode\n💰 Earn Zips from every challenge and spend them in the shop\n\nJoin the ZELZ Roblox group and community server for updates about development and related news!","path":